 117:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC.c **** * Summary:
 118:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC.c **** *  The start function initializes the voltage DAC with the default values, 
 119:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC.c **** *  and sets the power to the given level.  A power level of 0, is the same as
 120:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC.c **** *  executing the stop function.
 121:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC.c **** *
 122:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC.c **** * Parameters:
